## 7. Frontend Requirements (Vue.js)

### 7.1 Screens

#### Overview

Shows the monthly summary (household income, household expenditure, household budget balance) and grouped lists:
* Income grouped by person
* Expenses grouped by category and person

#### Kostenverteilung

Shows the backend-calculated cost split with transparent intermediate values, including Net result (shared).

#### Datenerfassung (Budget Items)

* list existing entries
* add shared income/expense
* add per-person income/expense
* add actual item (month override) for a specific item and month
* fields:

  * name (expenses only)
  * category
  * amount
  * type
  * frequency (monthly, quarterly, half-yearly, yearly, one-time)
  * start/end month for recurring items
  * one-time month for one-time items
  * optional category correction (Ist-Betrag) per month

#### Stammdaten

* categories split by income/expense
* persons list with inline rename

### 7.2 Layout & UI

* Vuetify baseline layout with left navigation
* Global month/year selector that controls all views
* All user-facing strings in German

